# `use` deconstructs dep's record R(int x, int y) with a record pattern. Swapping the components
# keeps every member and the canonical constructor's descriptor, yet changes what the pattern binds
# to each variable, so `use` must be recompiled even though it still compiles.
> use/compile
$ sleep 2000
$ copy-file changes/R.java dep/src/main/java/R.java
> use/checkRecompilations 1 A
